Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 01:33:30 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] vendor: add upstream BLAKE3 C library

Vendor the official BLAKE3 1.5.1 C implementation including portable,
ARM64 NEON, and x86 SSE2/SSE4.1/AVX2/AVX-512 SIMD kernels.

Original-Commit: 47946328a09713ccd079b1b37d3456946838254a
Original-Patch: v2/005
Split-Concern: whole

Historical compilation prerequisites are tracked separately in daemon/patch-audit;
this provenance-preserving split does not imply standalone build validation.
